{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>每天按時吃藥、記錄劑量、追蹤補充庫存，對許多人來說是一項繁瑣卻至關重要的任務。《Pill Scape》正是為了解決這個痛點而設計，它提供直觀的視覺提醒、靈活的鬧鐘設定與完整的用藥歷史，讓管理日常用藥變得輕鬆有條理。今天這款實用工具正限時免費，錯過可惜。</p>\n\n<h2>一鍵建立用藥清單，自訂提醒不漏吃</h2>\n<p>你可以在 App 中為每種藥物加入名稱、劑量、型態、備註與顏色標籤，並設定多組本地鬧鐘，選擇每日或僅工作日重複。從 Today 頁面即可標記已服、跳過或稍後提醒，搭配可選的藥瓶標籤照片與裝置端文字辨識，快速辨識藥物，所有資料都儲存在本地，無需註冊帳號，也沒有廣告或分析 SDK，完全保障你的隱私。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1320x2868bb-48-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1320x2868bb-49-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1320x2868bb-50-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1320x2868bb-51-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/2064x2752bb-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/2064x2752bb-1-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Pill Scape</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-10T22:01:24.095813+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":345,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}